  "Novel",
  "A Soho shopkeeper in the pay of a foreign embassy plots a bomb attack on Greenwich Observatory, and destroys his own family in the process.",
  "Mr Verloc, a lazy Soho shopkeeper who sells pornography and frequents anarchist meetings, is an agent of a foreign embassy. Ordered to stage an outrage against 'the fetish of science', he sends his simple-minded brother-in-law Stevie to carry a bomb to Greenwich; Stevie stumbles and is blown to pieces, and Verloc's wife Winnie, discovering the truth, murders him and is herself destroyed. The novel ends in a fogbound London of police, spies and solitary misery.",
